#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:7
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:10
msgid "Training API"
msgstr "训练 API"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:12
msgid ""
"The FastAPI development schema is available at `/docs`. The routes below are the "
"supported stable workflow surface documented here."
msgstr "FastAPI 开发 schema 位于 `/docs`。以下路由是本文档说明的受支持稳定工作流接口。"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:15
msgid "Service and catalog routes"
msgstr "服务与目录路由"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Method and path"
msgstr "方法和路径"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Response or effect"
msgstr "响应或作用"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`GET /api/health`"
msgstr "`GET /api/health`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Health, effective local or remote mode, remote source, and last validation state"
msgstr "健康状态、实际本地或远程模式、远程来源和上次验证状态"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`GET /api/node-definitions`"
msgstr "`GET /api/node-definitions`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Version-1 generated node manifest"
msgstr "版本 1 生成的节点 manifest"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`GET /api/node-categories`"
msgstr "`GET /api/node-categories`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Version-1 library categories plus dynamic user entries"
msgstr "版本 1 的库类别加上动态用户条目"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`GET /api/workspace`"
msgstr "`GET /api/workspace`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Load the version-3 workspace snapshot"
msgstr "加载版本 3 工作区快照"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/workspace`"
msgstr "`POST /api/workspace`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Validate and replace the workspace snapshot"
msgstr "验证并替换工作区快照"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /api/graph-library/{kind}`"
msgstr "`GET /api/graph-library/{kind}`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "List `workflows` and `templates`"
msgstr "列出 `workflows` 和 `templates`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /api/graph-library/{kind}`"
msgstr "`POST /api/graph-library/{kind}`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Add or replace one validated saved-graph entry"
msgstr "添加或替换一个已验证的已保存图条目"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE /api/graph-library/{kind}/{entry_id}`"
msgstr "`DELETE /api/graph-library/{kind}/{entry_id}`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Delete an entry and return the remaining list"
msgstr "删除一个条目并返回剩余列表"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:28
msgid "Single-run routes"
msgstr "单次运行路由"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "契约"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/train`"
msgstr "`POST /api/train`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Validate a `TrainRequest` and stream local or selected remote training"
msgstr "验证 `TrainRequest`，并流式传输本地或选定远程训练"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/train/control`"
msgstr "`POST /api/train/control`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Request `pause` or `abort` for a Trainer ID"
msgstr "为 Trainer ID 请求 `pause` 或 `abort`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`GET /api/train/cuda-devices`"
msgstr "`GET /api/train/cuda-devices`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "List detected local CUDA devices"
msgstr "列出检测到的本地 CUDA 设备"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`GET /api/train/remote/status`"
msgstr "`GET /api/train/remote/status`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Report effective remote mode and last validation state"
msgstr "报告实际远程模式和上次验证状态"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`GET /api/train/remote/config`"
msgstr "`GET /api/train/remote/config`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Return the stored remote configuration"
msgstr "返回已保存的远程配置"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/train/remote/config`"
msgstr "`POST /api/train/remote/config`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Replace the stored remote configuration"
msgstr "替换已保存的远程配置"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/train/remote/validate`"
msgstr "`POST /api/train/remote/validate`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Validate a supplied or effective remote connection"
msgstr "验证提供的或实际生效的远程连接"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/train/remote/bootstrap`"
msgstr "`POST /api/train/remote/bootstrap`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Synchronize and verify the remote runtime outside a train request"
msgstr "在训练请求之外同步并验证远程运行时"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:41
msgid ""
"`TrainRequest` contains `trainer_node_id`, `nodes`, `edges`, optional `resume` state,"
" and optional `hessian_oversized_policy` (`skip` or `force`). Nodes and edges are "
"validated using the graph schema before the run is prepared."
msgstr ""
"`TrainRequest` 包含 `trainer_node_id`、`nodes`、`edges`、可选的 `resume` 状态和可选的 "
"`hessian_oversized_policy`（`skip` 或 `force`）。准备运行前，节点和边会使用图 schema 验证。"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:45
msgid "NDJSON response"
msgstr "NDJSON 响应"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:47
msgid ""
"`POST /api/train` returns `application/x-ndjson`. Each line is a complete JSON "
"object. Clients must process the stream incrementally and must not parse the response"
" as one JSON document."
msgstr ""
"`POST /api/train` 返回 `application/x-ndjson`。每行都是一个完整 JSON 对象。客户端必须增量处理该流，不得将响应解析为一个 "
"JSON 文档。"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Event type"
msgstr "事件类型"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Meaning and stable fields"
msgstr "含义和稳定字段"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`progress`"
msgstr "`progress`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Run position with `step` and `total`"
msgstr "包含 `step` 和 `total` 的运行位置"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`phase`"
msgstr "`phase`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Remote bootstrap or execution phase with `phase` and `message`"
msgstr "包含 `phase` 和 `message` 的远程引导或执行阶段"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`complete`"
msgstr "`complete`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid ""
"Terminal success with checkpoint, loss histories, ticks, visualization targets, and "
"Observable updates"
msgstr "终止成功，包含检查点、损失历史、ticks、可视化目标和 Observable 更新"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`paused`"
msgstr "`paused`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid ""
"Terminal pause for this stream with `next_step` plus resumable checkpoint and "
"histories"
msgstr "此流终止暂停，包含 `next_step` 以及可恢复的检查点和历史"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`aborted`"
msgstr "`aborted`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Terminal cooperative abort"
msgstr "终止的协作式中止"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`error`"
msgstr "`error`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Terminal remote-stream error with `detail`"
msgstr "包含 `detail` 的终止远程流错误"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:60
msgid ""
"Non-finite numeric values are converted to JSON `null` before encoding so each line "
"remains valid RFC 8259 JSON."
msgstr "编码前会将非有限数值转换为 JSON `null`，以确保每行仍是有效的 RFC 8259 JSON。"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:63
msgid ""
"For a normal local run the documented sequence begins with one or more `progress` "
"events and ends in `complete`, `paused`, or `aborted`. Remote runs can emit `phase` "
"before training and can terminate with `error` if the SSH process fails without "
"another terminal event."
msgstr ""
"正常本地运行的文档化序列以一个或多个 `progress` 事件开始，并以 `complete`、`paused` 或 `aborted` 结束。远程运行可在训练前发出 "
"`phase`，若 SSH 进程失败且没有其他终止事件，则可以 `error` 结束。"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:68
msgid "Sweep routes"
msgstr "扫参路由"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/train/sweep`"
msgstr "`POST /api/train/sweep`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid ""
"Stream `sweep_started`, `sweep_progress`, `sweep_row`, then `sweep_complete` or "
"`sweep_aborted`"
msgstr ""
"依次流式传输 `sweep_started`、`sweep_progress`、`sweep_row`，然后是 `sweep_complete` 或 "
"`sweep_aborted`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/train/sweep/control`"
msgstr "`POST /api/train/sweep/control`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Request sweep abort between single-run iterations"
msgstr "在单次运行迭代之间请求中止扫参"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/train/coordinate-descent`"
msgstr "`POST /api/train/coordinate-descent`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Stream coordinate-descent tuning events"
msgstr "流式传输坐标下降调优事件"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "`POST /api/train/coordinate-descent/control`"
msgstr "`POST /api/train/coordinate-descent/control`"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:6
msgid "Request coordinate-descent abort by session ID"
msgstr "按会话 ID 请求中止坐标下降"

#: ../../en/reference/training-api.md:77
msgid ""
"These route contracts do not define a scientific acceptance threshold. The client or "
"experiment protocol must decide what result counts as success."
msgstr "这些路由契约不定义科学验收阈值。客户端或实验协议必须决定何种结果算作成功。"
